{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0363_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0363_1000_p", "source_sha256": "91a930c7a35bd9d1352dfe739f8d765acb4dbcc971a4192614695c5ee9859ed1", "ja": "（今日はグラビア雑誌『アイグラ！！』の撮影日だ。\nさて、百合子の様子はどうだろう？）", "zh": "（今天是《偶像写真！！》杂志的拍摄日。\n那么，百合子的情况怎么样了？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0363_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0363_1001_026yur", "source_sha256": "9e29e45dd0eccc8a9a0df9ae34fd3979d9c040323e2c24a85b87456292b8a46c", "ja": "{$P$}さん、いらっしゃいませ！\nご注文はお決まりですか？　……なんちゃって♪", "zh": "{$P$}先生，欢迎光临！\n请问您决定好点什么了吗？……开玩笑的啦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0363_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0363_1002_p", "source_sha256": "d7df9a834b442286580f4e466d99f21c751b43ba70572222c2d3852ce0532b87", "ja": "ははっ。お疲れ様、百合子。\n衣装、よく似合ってるじゃないか！", "zh": "哈哈。辛苦了，百合子。\n这身服装很适合你嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0363_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0363_1003_026yur", "source_sha256": "331f0b314754c03113d0ffbd3431a11a12f057b9883935179a9ecfb6f7911662", "ja": "本当ですか！　えへへ……この衣装を着てると、\n実際に、カフェの店員さんになった気分になるんです。", "zh": "真的吗！嘿嘿……穿上这身服装，就真的有种自己成了咖啡馆店员的感觉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0363_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0363_1004_026yur", "source_sha256": "9abf73eb4d39a35d88280c603341caae78ca17d4025a345b6a9cffc6424bb1c7", "ja": "私がここで働いたら……。そんな妄想でいっぱいで。\n素敵な衣装を、本当にありがとうございます♪", "zh": "要是我真的在这里工作的话……。脑子里全是这样的幻想呢。\n这么漂亮的衣装，真的非常感谢您♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0363_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0363_1005_p", "source_sha256": "c72932732c0149b54422c7921f8ef8f5df9bb29d0ce7b921add73d80d74feac0", "ja": "妄想が捗るくらい喜んでもらえて嬉しいよ。\nしかし、百合子はカフェの店員に憧れてたのか？", "zh": "看到你开心到都开始畅想了，我也很高兴。\n不过，百合子原来憧憬过当咖啡店店员吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0363_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0363_1006_026yur", "source_sha256": "dc6c9d30bfd89f76e3411e379edc975c567b5533c8ac467973579a6bdfa441b2", "ja": "憧れってほどではないですけど……。この前行った\nカフェの店員さんが、かっこよかったんです！", "zh": "还算不上憧憬……不过，之前去的那家咖啡店的店员，真的很帅气！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0363_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0363_1007_026yur", "source_sha256": "4d89dc6a55a3c6cdb5965ae1a3327225011da3d8e3c9d4e8811ebb58ab774cab", "ja": "いろんなテーブルの注文を瞬時に受けたり、\nたくさんのお料理を一度で運んだり……。", "zh": "瞬间就能记下好几桌的点单，\n还能一次端很多菜……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0363_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0363_1008_026yur", "source_sha256": "cc87663349cdc5be1785a8e2a87c3bc70cbd074c4bccf71edf54dc7c1ff96f42", "ja": "なんでもテキパキこなせて、すごいなぁって。\n私じゃ、あんな上手にできないと思います。", "zh": "什么都能利落地完成，真是厉害啊。\n要是我的话，肯定做不到那么熟练。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0363_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0363_1009_p", "source_sha256": "a226ed305f369267f3fa09e5bc7c511e95c1c7190b5ee93abe9ad7618256b3c9", "ja": "まあ、慣れもあるだろうけど……。\nスマートにこなせる店員さんは、確かにカッコいいな！", "zh": "也是熟能生巧吧……\n不过能利落应对各种状况的店员，确实很帅气呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0363_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0363_1010_026yur", "source_sha256": "329f54fa9f76d2ad6b604ce1d9165658817cd7137146c41d89ebe85d059ee4ab", "ja": "はい♪　だから私、楽しみだったんです！\n格好だけとはいえ、店員さんになれますから！", "zh": "没错♪所以我一直很期待！\n毕竟就算只是穿得像，也能当一回店员嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0363_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0363_1011_p", "source_sha256": "961227214ef74ce0e865c1a9983110cc42ef16450302cd76df9c28371529d7c8", "ja": "おお。気合い十分って感じだな。", "zh": "哦，干劲十足嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0363_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0363_1012_026yur", "source_sha256": "59023860054b490cda212f0011903b2aac2bafa7ec0250f5ba00117eb6b5b18a", "ja": "えへへ。あの店員さんと同じようにはできないけど、\n私なりのおもてなしで、頑張ります！", "zh": "嘿嘿。虽然没法做到和那位店员一样，但我会用自己的待客之道加油的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
